sam: Quick smoke — adjusted sample to return bytes and used `response.use { it.byteStream().bufferedReader().readText() }`. Re-ran CTs and socket exhaustion didn't occur.

nina: Action items: (1) change example in quickstart to use auto-closing helpers + show Flow-based streaming example with `callbackFlow` and `awaitClose { call.cancel() }` (2) add a short note in SDK README about closing Response/body (3) add an integration test that cancels mid-stream and asserts pool size doesn't grow.

leo: Also file a follow-up to make a lightweight Response wrapper implementing Closeable so kotlinx adapters can call `use` idiomatically.

